<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Macro for the AK-47 (Standing)


!!! Important !!!
You should set these in-game /// FOV (graphics.fov 90 in F1) and Sensitivity (input.sensitivity 0.9 in F1)

Mouse used: Trust GXT 95  ///   DPI: 1600
If possible you should use the Macro on Mouse1
Run the Program in Incognito Mode


(Program Settings !!!)
Run the Program in Incognito Mode
Install the Keyran Driver if you didn't do so
Snap to Window: Off

(Key Settings)
Use minimal delay when pressing keys in macros: Off
React only to physical clicks on keyboards and mice: On
Block modifier keystrokes: On

(Mouse Settings)
Enhance pointer precision: Off



I wish you all a nice day!</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
